/target
Cargo.lock

# Harness state — never operate on. See docs/COMPACTION-AMNESIA-RECOVERY.md § FM 7-bis.
.claude/worktrees/

# Ephemeral arc/stone cascade tooling (build → use → delete). Repo-local scratch
# pad — the sandbox firewall denies /tmp/. See docs/DUNGEON-CRAWL.md § cascade.
/tools/

# Coverage artifacts (arc 252 gate). LLVM_PROFILE_FILE emits *.profraw; an
# instrumented build that lingers makes plain `cargo test` drop default_*.profraw
# in CWD. The lcov is regenerated each gate run. Never commit either.
*.profraw
coverage.lcov
/coverage.lcov

# Scratchpad — disconfirming probes + scratch. Worked-reference probes worth
# keeping are committed deliberately (git add -f); everything else stays local.
/scratchpad/
